{"h":3406,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.06773168905903186,"w":0.12635397593180336,"h":0.016298699504966541,"y":0.037503092537838789,"c":1},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.068041225104011144,"t":"HELEN: Right. OK, now I did a draft of the section of sources of possible error in our","y":0.085731062702855021,"w":0.7113402303059897},{"w":0.68865976969401044,"t":"research, but I don't know if you agree. For example, the size of the sample, and","x":0.13402063056536587,"y":0.10174418611499836,"c":1,"h":0.017457223400534794},{"y":0.11918604644438147,"h":0.01322734180927565,"x":0.1381443227247332,"t":"whether it's big enough to make any general conclusions from. But I thought actually","w":0.71752578735351569,"c":1},{"x":0.13814432688888284,"y":0.13505578379547445,"h":0.013211978860833806,"w":0.27010309855143227,"c":1,"t":"we did have quite a big sample."},{"c":1,"h":0.0076007871017411688,"t":"COLIN:","x":0.067990875632861381,"y":0.15390309480469899,"w":0.047523403167724618},{"w":0.71546391805013021,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"x":0.13608247386062847,"t":"We did. And our general method of observation seemed quite reliable. But we might","y":0.15116279074764216},{"c":1,"x":0.13809659183913894,"h":0.01452130145769015,"t":"not be all that accurate as far as the actual numbers go.","y":0.16580546249249806,"w":0.47642100016276046},{"x":0.067953435055485595,"c":1,"w":0.051721995671590165,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.0092510485467109937,"y":0.18578145245164612},{"w":0.7217635091145832,"t":"Yeah, we might have missed some organisms - if they were hiding under a rock, for.","h":0.017536011010985897,"c":1,"y":0.18161879861751962,"x":0.13603194474469557},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.19906048174802726,"w":0.69278350830078128,"t":"example. I wasn't sure about the way we described their habitats. I decided it was","x":0.13814432822786615,"c":1},{"x":0.39493388401666979,"w":0.5708407592773439,"h":0.064219666871335734,"c":0.30000001192092896,"y":0.15677397043474917,"t":"onhersanigms - fhey were hiding unde a f uk. for. 029 & 30"},{"t":"probably OK.","w":0.11563933054606118,"x":0.13599476792209003,"h":0.015242850437489075,"c":1,"y":0.21476229564966309},{"c":1,"x":0.068007711621876396,"t":"COLIN:","w":0.04542787551879883,"y":0.23392431138920611,"h":0.0088955632252897265},{"x":0.13814433870610618,"y":0.23106283010161788,"w":0.67422678629557287,"t":"Yeah, and the descriptions we gave of the smaller organisms, they weren't very","h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1},{"h":0.01828062961329735,"c":1,"w":0.69081400553385419,"t":"detailed, but they were adequate in this context. I'm not sure we identified all the.","x":0.13602478969878015,"y":0.24643466980474216},{"h":0.014071817896468275,"w":0.086888605753580817,"y":0.24659781196644104,"t":"Q29 & 30","c":1,"x":0.87201961454287391},{"t":"species correctly though.","y":0.26453317677003385,"h":0.013211978860833806,"c":1,"x":0.13608247741317755,"w":0.2144329833984375},{"x":0.068022072600262148,"w":0.051584720611572266,"c":1,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.010271179907054506,"y":0.28192836350289263},{"t":"OK, we'd better mention that. Now, how ...","h":0.01746575774967285,"x":0.12577319535204234,"y":0.27906976772122216,"w":0.3731958770751953,"c":1},{"x":0.065979384153272438,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"t":"SECTION 4","w":0.16701030731201172,"y":0.32994186043456297},{"x":0.063917528028573548,"t":"We ve been discussing the factors the architect has to consider when designing domestic","y":0.36046511632916034,"w":0.76082473754882818,"h":0.014534883616744931,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.37639459761008132,"w":0.7278350321451823,"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.063917535371002435,"t":"buildings. I'm going to move on now to consider the design of public buildings, and I'll"},{"w":0.78144327799479174,"x":0.063917536153541052,"y":0.39244186051520147,"t":"illustrate this by referring to the new Taylor Concert Hall that's recently been completed here","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"t":"in the city.","x":0.06157951152100407,"y":0.40886679299268902,"c":1,"w":0.0934545071919759,"h":0.013891484411198141},{"t":"So, as with a domestic building, when designing a public building, an architect needs to","x":0.065979375809704852,"y":0.43159130923745903,"w":0.74020619710286462,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.7958762613932292,"y":0.44767441857409795,"t":"consider the function of the building - for example, is it to be used primarily for entertainment,","x":0.063917543220911172,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"or for education, or for administration? The second thing the architect needs to think about","x":0.065979388684052176,"w":0.76701029459635417,"c":1,"y":0.46506165604239713},{"w":0.79381444295247394,"y":0.48110465132953806,"x":0.063917520706497352,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"t":"is the context of the building, this includes its physical location, obviously, but italso includes."},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"the social meaning of the building, how it relates to the people its built for. And finally, for","y":0.49706400483785673,"w":0.7525773111979166,"x":0.065979385580032884},{"w":0.76494847615559891,"h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.5130813955158281,"c":1,"t":"important public buildings, the architect may also be looking for a central symbolic idea on","x":0.063917514388978414},{"y":0.5290663533093376,"h":0.015991786054072477,"x":0.063917536158644067,"w":0.78144327799479174,"c":1,"t":"which to base the design, a sort of metaphor for the building and the way in which it is used."},{"x":0.063852593787439668,"t":"Let's look at the new Taylor Concert Hall in relation to these ideas. The location chosen.","y":0.5514230839569525,"w":0.74447168986002599,"c":1,"h":0.016911858330736051},{"c":1,"t":"was a site in a run-down district that has been ignored in previous redevelopment plans. It","w":0.76494847615559902,"x":0.063917514409668572,"h":0.013081395479069058,"y":0.56976744179334904},{"t":"was occupied by a factory that had been empty for some years. The whole area was some","y":0.58573106271018394,"x":0.063917519369571588,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.77113403320312501},{"h":0.018202906556501919,"w":0.78165908813476559,"c":1,"x":0.065888802965054741,"t":"distance from the high-rise office blocks of the central business district and shopping centre,","y":0.59811564478314017},{"h":0.017317378233967284,"c":1,"t":"but it was only one kilometre from the ring road. The site itself was bordered to the north by a","w":0.79599975585937499,"x":0.063861717972078513,"y":0.61497228827335282},{"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.78556696573893237,"t":"canal which had once been used by boats bringing in raw materials when the area was used","y":0.63226744173087179,"x":0.063917548341874048},{"t":"for manufacturing.","w":0.15978177388509116,"y":0.64697960508515084,"x":0.061426539192142492,"h":0.017654722463503636,"c":1},{"h":0.013211978860833806,"y":0.67293012314064837,"w":0.77525772094726564,"t":"The architect chosen for the project was Tom Harrison. He found the main design challenge","c":1,"x":0.068041242509924868},{"c":1,"y":0.68895348853829586,"w":0.78350514729817711,"t":"was the location of the site in an area that had no neighbouring buildings of any importance.","x":0.061855673681687429,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"t":"To reflect the fact that the significance of the building in this quite run-down location was","h":0.01657683752735295,"y":0.70398992247722003,"c":1,"x":0.06384590510940702,"w":0.74653401692708332},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"w":0.74432988484700524,"x":0.063917531794838667,"y":0.72078684669600979,"t":"as yet unknown, he decided to create a building centred around the idea of a mystery -"},{"t":"something whose meaning still has to be discovered.","x":0.06590387032002748,"c":1,"h":0.01543144611351932,"y":0.73686465129285306,"w":0.44961959838867188},{"w":0.74639175415039061,"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.76159718168991442,"x":0.063917524882123669,"c":1,"t":"So how was this reflected in the design of the building? Well, Harrison decided to create"},{"c":1,"y":0.77761627911980136,"t":"pedestrian access to the building and to make use of the presence of water on the site. As","h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.76907216389973954,"x":0.061855670525525187},{"y":0.79359953004035699,"w":0.74639175415039061,"h":0.014679976512037674,"c":1,"t":"people approach the entrance, they therefore have to cross over a bridge. He wanted to","x":0.063917524969478265},{"w":0.7525773111979166,"c":1,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"give people a feeling of suspense as they see the building first from a distance, and then","x":0.063917529858288441,"y":0.80945390512951332},{"w":0.77122802734375007,"h":0.016699858714186,"x":0.063866676795578697,"y":0.82503909319935953,"t":"close-up, and the initial impression he wanted to create from the shape of the building as a","c":1},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"w":0.77113403320312501,"x":0.061855663744703311,"y":0.8414562534846185,"c":1,"t":"whole was that of a box. The first side that people see, the southern wall, is just a high, flat"},{"x":0.063917521277180825,"t":"wall uninterrupted by any windows. This might sound off-putting, but it supports Harrison's","w":0.76288660685221354,"y":0.8575581395833608,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"t":"concept of the building - that the person approaching is intrigued and wonders what will be","w":0.77113403320312501,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"x":0.06391751938815958,"y":0.87345860239869044},{"h":0.016576286490636916,"c":1,"x":0.063863424171876487,"t":"inside. And this flat wall also has another purpose. At night-time, projectors are switched on","y":0.88907394142194685,"w":0.77330256144205722},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"and it functions as a huge screen, onto which images are proiected.","y":0.9054609510520133,"c":1,"w":0.57319585164388021,"x":0.063917543538884541},{"w":0.039175256093343096,"x":0.059793815149204739,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"112","y":0.94622093024190124},{"t":"QЗ4","y":0.77761627896617691,"x":0.87010309349972015,"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.039175256093343047,"c":1},{"y":0.82558139524738416,"w":0.039175256093343158,"c":1,"x":0.87010309350544746,"t":"Q35","h":0.013081395479068947},{"y":0.88953488361493505,"w":0.039175256093343047,"c":1,"x":0.87010309350616355,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"Q36"},{"y":0.95184119336244677,"w":0.29384368896484375,"h":0.025161001728481236,"c":1,"x":0.35202311724307528,"t":"leltsresources.org"}],"w":2400}